🔥 ANSWER TO YOUR QUESTION:
═══════════════════════════════════════════

knowledge_base/ folder is at ROOT LEVEL
(same level as app/, tests/, .env)

NOT inside app/rag/

Why at root?
- Easy to access
- Easy to add files
- Separate from code
- Standard practice

═══════════════════════════════════════════
HOW TO ADD YOUR DOCUMENTS:
═══════════════════════════════════════════

1. Go to: backend-enhanced-final/knowledge_base/documents/

2. Add your files:
   - PDFs: your-doc.pdf
   - Text: your-doc.txt
   - Markdown: your-doc.md
   - Word: your-doc.docx

3. Reload:
   curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/knowledge-base/reload

Done!

